  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.23 \"Ozone season\" means \"ozone season\" as defined in Env-A 1211.01(ah), namely, \"the period between May 1 and September 30, inclusive.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
